{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"698489628289925130","content":"\"Would you ask that i partake in the war? Or stand aside? And is this war between the uru and the fishmonger's tribe?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T20:15:37.051000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743201044645019819","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"698489628289925130","content":"\"You are free to do as you wish. Most things sprung into motion will not be changed by your petty little town. We have all we need. This blood and a few other sacrifices will reign in all I need\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T20:17:30.860000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743201521994301535","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"698489628289925130","content":"\"And if the town decides to act?... If the town somehow thwarts the war by some miracle... As long as there are bodies and blood... You don't care what happens yes?\" He pauses... \"What if the uru fall?\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T20:20:21.303000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743202236884189294","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
